What more is there to be said?


00:18:39.048 --> 00:18:40.115
Jeez...


00:18:41.050 --> 00:18:43.990
This is disgusting.


00:18:48.792 --> 00:18:50.692
Jesus, that was heavier
than I thought.


00:18:50.694 --> 00:18:52.728
- Yeah.
- Dead bodies always are.


00:18:53.130 --> 00:18:55.565
Hey, Babe?
Can you grab my carry-on?


00:18:56.467 --> 00:18:58.803
I'm not gonna wander around the
desert dressed like this.


00:19:01.105 --> 00:19:03.406
Probably have something for you,
if you want.


00:19:04.108 --> 00:19:05.974
I like what I'm wearing.


00:19:05.976 --> 00:19:07.476
What about your heels?


00:19:07.478 --> 00:19:09.748
I like how they make my legs look.


00:19:12.750 --> 00:19:14.816
Hallelujah to that.


00:19:29.999 --> 00:19:32.399
There's gotta be a map in
here somewhere.


00:19:41.612 --> 00:19:43.813
Like it's not hot enough
out here already.


00:19:44.815 --> 00:19:46.215
Find anything?


00:19:46.917 --> 00:19:48.984
Ah, no. No. Not yet.


00:19:59.963 --> 00:20:01.830
I'd kill for an aspirin right now.


00:20:01.932 --> 00:20:03.932
Well how about one of these?


00:20:04.134 --> 00:20:06.268
Ohh, Vicodin.


00:20:07.093 --> 00:20:08.069
Where did you get those?


00:20:08.270 --> 00:20:10.874
Underneath the seat
where your hubby was sitting.


00:20:12.176 --> 00:20:15.511
Where the hell would I get
something like that from?


00:20:16.113 --> 00:20:17.079
Relax.


00:20:17.081 --> 00:20:21.817
I'm pulling your leg, man.
We can all thank Lizzy.


00:20:21.919 --> 00:20:26.789
Yeah. Lizzy. My assistant.
She borrowed the car.


00:20:27.291 --> 00:20:30.058
That woman has a brutal memory
but a great ass.


00:20:30.160 --> 00:20:31.193
Hey.


00:20:31.695 --> 00:20:33.595
Look, that was a long time
ago, Babe.


00:20:33.597 --> 00:20:34.597
All right, down the hatch.


00:20:34.698 --> 00:20:37.436
That's okay.
We all have a past.


00:20:40.938 --> 00:20:41.686
Wanna play?


00:20:50.881 --> 00:20:54.583
They're just painkillers.
We've got a long way ahead of us.


00:20:54.885 --> 00:20:56.187
Let's go.


00:20:59.189 --> 00:21:00.489
Saddle up!


00:21:01.291 --> 00:21:03.391
I can't believe you've
been holding this whole time.


00:21:03.393 --> 00:21:04.726
Yeah, now we be sharing.


00:21:04.728 --> 00:21:06.329
I'm sorry I doubted you.


00:21:07.331 --> 00:21:09.602
Forget it. Come on.


00:21:13.904 --> 00:21:15.971
BILLY Come on, slow pokes.


00:21:50.039 --> 00:21:51.139
Whooo!


00:21:54.978 --> 00:21:58.417
Roy, come on, man.
That is some good shit.


00:22:01.819 --> 00:22:02.767
Oh fuck it.


00:22:09.993 --> 00:22:13.797
We just survived a car crash, saw a
woman die right in front of us, and...


00:22:15.599 --> 00:22:17.565
we're stuck in the middle
of the fucking desert.


00:22:17.567 --> 00:22:19.001
Why don't you cut me some slack?


00:22:19.103 --> 00:22:20.368
I know, but after everything...


00:22:20.370 --> 00:22:21.137
I can handle it.


00:22:21.839 --> 00:22:23.371
All right, Jamie.
Have a hit.


00:22:23.373 --> 00:22:25.073
Don't push your luck, Billy.


00:22:25.175 --> 00:22:30.846
You know, it might be in all our best
interests if we just try to remain mellow.


00:22:30.848 --> 00:22:31.813
Is that so?


00:22:32.015 --> 00:22:33.215
It's a proven fact.


00:22:33.217 --> 00:22:36.318
People do crazy shit in the desert.


00:22:36.720 --> 00:22:40.288
Taking in all this vast expanse,
you mix in it with


00:22:40.290 --> 00:22:43.124
some sun stroke, and voila la!


00:22:43.126 --> 00:22:45.794
You got yourself a
bad batch of juju.


00:22:46.096 --> 00:22:49.197
Yeah, we get scripts sent to us
all the time about this shit.


00:22:49.199 --> 00:22:50.633
You mean movies?


00:22:51.435 --> 00:22:56.005
Like I could turn psycho
and drink all your blood?


00:22:57.107 --> 00:23:02.375
- Ahhh... Jesus... vampire!
- Get off... Ahhh!


00:23:06.082 --> 00:23:09.084
You know, I guess we should be
happy we're still alive.


00:23:09.486 --> 00:23:11.854
Yeah, we should.


00:23:12.156 --> 00:23:13.422
And you know what...?


00:23:14.424 --> 00:23:17.095
The highway's gonna show up
before we even know it.


00:23:20.497 --> 00:23:22.833
Then why don't you
give me a ride.


00:23:25.035 --> 00:23:26.802
Go get them. Haha!


00:23:31.240 --> 00:23:33.008
Whooo!


00:23:57.466 --> 00:23:59.966
I didn't spill my drink.


00:24:07.377 --> 00:24:09.444
I say we just keep walking to Vegas.


00:24:09.446 --> 00:24:12.014
Well aren't you awful
horny to get there.


00:24:12.516 --> 00:24:14.117
Fuck, yeah, aren't you?


00:24:15.219 --> 00:24:19.688
Tell you the truth, baby, everything
to me is a little hazy right now.


00:24:19.790 --> 00:24:22.692
Hey, you did propose.


00:24:24.294 --> 00:24:28.997
I witnessed it.
You're a hell of a romantic, Billy.


00:24:29.099 --> 00:24:32.770
Come on. Can't a guy get a
fucking break around here.


00:24:35.072 --> 00:24:37.773
Come on, I'm joking. Ok?


00:24:38.075 --> 00:24:39.774
Who wouldn't want to marry this face...


00:24:39.776 --> 00:24:43.376
and those gorgeous,
wrap-around legs.


00:24:49.386 --> 00:24:54.657
Let's go to Vegas! I promise,
you will not regret it.


00:24:55.259 --> 00:24:57.129
You are killing me, woman.


00:25:01.031 --> 00:25:03.033
I know what the blue ones are for.


00:25:05.035 --> 00:25:06.269
I just don't need them.


00:25:07.971 --> 00:25:09.004
Whooo!


00:25:09.006 --> 00:25:11.106
Vegas! Whooo!


00:25:14.244 --> 00:25:15.644
Gimme that ass!


00:25:16.446 --> 00:25:18.513
Hahaha!


00:25:23.486 --> 00:25:24.953
Come on! Let's go!


00:25:24.955 --> 00:25:27.022
Come on, slow pokes!


00:25:34.864 --> 00:25:36.833
Shouldn't we see something by now?


00:25:38.035 --> 00:25:39.168
We will.


00:25:40.370 --> 00:25:41.606
What is it?


00:25:44.508 --> 00:25:45.975
Just, ah...


00:25:46.977 --> 00:25:48.209
I'm just...


00:25:48.211 --> 00:25:49.979
Fuck, I'm hot!


00:25:50.981 --> 00:25:54.182
That's not nothing.
You're cut. Deep.


00:25:54.284 --> 00:25:57.185
Broken bottle of tequila.
Doesn't matter.


00:25:57.387 --> 00:26:01.056
Holy Fuck. You look like
one of them freaks from Oz.


00:26:01.058 --> 00:26:03.892
You know Billy, he's hurt.
Just leave him alone.


00:26:04.094 --> 00:26:06.061
Let me take a look.


00:26:06.063 --> 00:26:07.996
I'm fine.


00:26:07.998 --> 00:26:09.097
Look, Billy...


00:26:09.099 --> 00:26:12.935
I've done my time.
And it's done. Ok?


00:26:14.137 --> 00:26:15.138
It's done.


00:26:16.440 --> 00:26:18.373
- Babe, come on.
- You need to rest.


00:26:18.375 --> 00:26:20.441
Yeah, come on, bro.
Look, you're bleeding like hell.


00:26:20.443 --> 00:26:24.113
- Look. I'm fine. Ok?
- You see this?


00:26:24.915 --> 00:26:26.247
That will take care of it.


00:26:26.249 --> 00:26:29.117
All right.
We just need to keep moving.


00:26:29.119 --> 00:26:30.285
You can't keep taking those.


00:26:30.287 --> 00:26:31.886
Let him take two if it'll help.


00:26:31.888 --> 00:26:32.854
It's not your business.


00:26:32.856 --> 00:26:36.826
Enough! Ok? We're moving.


00:26:38.228 --> 00:26:39.496
Now!


00:26:41.698 --> 00:26:42.542
Come on!


00:26:50.173 --> 00:26:52.140
What do you think he did?


00:26:52.142 --> 00:26:54.147
Hopefully not his cell-mate.


00:26:59.649 --> 00:27:01.950
It's gotta be five miles by now.


00:27:01.952 --> 00:27:04.219
Ah, man. I'd kill for a mojito.


00:27:04.621 --> 00:27:06.322
And a cheeseburger.


00:27:07.624 --> 00:27:09.625
Where the hell is this road?


00:27:10.127 --> 00:27:12.995
Baby, you could get drunk
off my sweat right now.


00:27:13.697 --> 00:27:15.097
You wanna stop?


00:27:15.699 --> 00:27:17.433
Only if you do.


00:27:18.135 --> 00:27:19.634
Yeah, I can stop.


00:27:19.636 --> 00:27:23.341
Ah, Hey! Guys. Annie needs
to take a break.


00:27:26.443 --> 00:27:28.343
What is that?


00:27:28.345 --> 00:27:30.812
Not what. Who?


00:27:52.701 --> 00:27:54.740
What the fuck?


00:27:58.542 --> 00:28:00.508
No shit.


00:28:00.510 --> 00:28:02.181
What do you think happened?


00:28:06.383 --> 00:28:07.315
Be careful.


00:28:07.317 --> 00:28:08.685
Because why?


00:28:10.487 --> 00:28:12.554
No ID's.


00:28:12.556 --> 00:28:14.122
He looks like a gangster.


00:28:14.124 --> 00:28:15.256
Or a Fed.


00:28:15.258 --> 00:28:17.058
Looks like someone left in a hurry.


00:28:17.260 --> 00:28:19.194
Yeah... wouldn't you?


00:28:19.196 --> 00:28:22.664
Ok, guys.
This is too fucked up.


00:28:22.766 --> 00:28:24.700
This is just too fucked up.


00:28:25.602 --> 00:28:28.436
You think he has something to do
with the dead woman in your trunk?


00:28:28.638 --> 00:28:30.805
Oh, yeah, what,
she's a murderer too?


00:28:30.807 --> 00:28:32.640
No, no, no...


00:28:32.642 --> 00:28:36.644
Tyre tracks go the other way.
Long way for her to go.


00:28:36.646 --> 00:28:39.047
Gut-shot and naked in the cold night.


00:28:39.349 --> 00:28:41.416
Looks like someone came a
long way for something.


00:28:41.418 --> 00:28:43.018
Or someone.


00:28:43.120 --> 00:28:44.920
Oh, great.


00:28:45.322 --> 00:28:47.455
So in this entire hell of a place,


00:28:47.457 --> 00:28:50.578
we look for one person to help us
and we keep finding the dead ones.


00:28:51.627 --> 00:28:54.698
And today of all days.


00:28:56.600 --> 00:28:58.533
Do you think we should do
something with the body?


00:28:58.535 --> 00:29:00.902
No, no, no. Fuck him.


00:29:01.204 --> 00:29:03.972
I say we forget we even saw him.


00:29:04.074 --> 00:29:06.055
We have enough
problems of our own.


00:29:08.077 --> 00:29:11.913
Look, you think that maybe we
can stop for a rest now, Roy?


00:29:11.915 --> 00:29:13.515
No, no, no.
We should keep walking.


00:29:14.217 --> 00:29:18.620
The woman needs to take a break,
for Christ's sake.


00:29:19.222 --> 00:29:20.890
Look, give me the bag.


00:29:22.292 --> 00:29:25.963
- You fucking kidding?
- Here's your damn bag.


00:29:28.465 --> 00:29:29.532
Fucker.


00:29:31.234 --> 00:29:34.303
Annie, come on.
Let's get the fuck out of here.


00:29:35.205 --> 00:29:37.873
You know I think you might
need a rest too.


00:29:38.675 --> 00:29:41.076
They're crashing.
It'll be hard to get them...


00:29:41.077 --> 00:29:44.777
Then you should care about whoever
made those tyre tracks coming back.


00:29:54.791 --> 00:29:55.958
Come on.


00:30:15.811 --> 00:30:17.879
- Whoa, whoa, wait.
- I need to stop.


00:30:21.483 --> 00:30:23.118
We should never have come.


00:30:23.720 --> 00:30:25.955
Nobody was coming
along that road.


00:30:27.457 --> 00:30:29.058
I mean the whole trip.


00:30:30.760 --> 00:30:32.596
Yeah, it was your idea.


00:30:34.598 --> 00:30:37.031
I'm not saying it wasn't.
I'm saying we shouldn't have.


00:30:37.033 --> 00:30:39.203
Yeah, well we did,
so that's that.


00:30:42.205 --> 00:30:43.439
Hey.


00:30:44.441 --> 00:30:45.974
You wanna partake?


00:30:46.576 --> 00:30:48.043
Yeah.


00:30:55.317 --> 00:30:56.220
What?


00:30:58.822 --> 00:30:59.921
I didn't say a word.


00:30:59.923 --> 00:31:01.757
Your face said enough.


00:31:02.759 --> 00:31:04.559
What do you want from me, Roy?


00:31:04.961 --> 00:31:07.964
I know what you're thinking.


00:31:09.366 --> 00:31:12.468
Trust me. You have no idea.


00:31:13.570 --> 00:31:17.138
I'm tired, I'm hot, and I'm
fucking sore.


00:31:17.140 --> 00:31:18.240
Is that what you wanna hear?


00:31:19.342 --> 00:31:21.142
Huh? Is it?


00:31:21.344 --> 00:31:24.712
Come on, guys. Billy's right.
Let's just stay cool.


00:31:24.914 --> 00:31:29.718
No, you know what.
You especially should hear this.


00:31:30.820 --> 00:31:32.553
People aren't always as they appear.


00:31:32.555 --> 00:31:33.921
Girl like you should learn that.


00:31:33.923 --> 00:31:34.922
Here it comes.


00:31:34.924 --> 00:31:37.792
Think that tough guy act
gets me hot?


00:31:37.794 --> 00:31:39.727
Isn't that why you wrote me
in the first place?


00:31:39.729 --> 00:31:41.696
I wrote you because of my church.


00:31:41.698 --> 00:31:43.564
- Oh please.
- You got off on it.


00:31:43.566 --> 00:31:46.903
Yeah, because writing to
degenerates is so sexy.


00:31:48.505 --> 00:31:51.407
So I'm a degenerate now? Huh?


00:31:52.709 --> 00:31:54.976
Whoa! Ok...


00:31:59.014 --> 00:32:04.882
This is all very..
very entertaining but...


00:32:05.287 --> 00:32:07.022
what the hell are you guys
talking about?


00:32:07.324 --> 00:32:11.460
That's right, you don't know
how we actually met, do you?


00:32:12.262 --> 00:32:17.432
Let me tell you. Jamie here was
slumming it, getting her jollies


00:32:17.534 --> 00:32:22.037
writing to cons, trying
to save a few souls.


00:32:22.539 --> 00:32:26.141
No way. Haha!


00:32:26.943 --> 00:32:28.509
It wasn't like that.


00:32:28.511 --> 00:32:30.377
I was just some punk ass
drug dealer


00:32:30.379 --> 00:32:31.946
you could take home like a stray.


00:32:31.948 --> 00:32:33.681
You made me believe you
wanted to change.


00:32:33.783 --> 00:32:37.152
Don't kid yourself!
You believe what you want to!


00:32:37.354 --> 00:32:39.357
Billy, did you know any of this?


00:32:42.359 --> 00:32:43.159
Look...


00:32:44.761 --> 00:32:47.595
Lizzy didn't sell me these, ok...


00:32:47.797 --> 00:32:49.065
Roy did.


00:32:50.767 --> 00:32:52.334
No shit?


00:32:53.336 --> 00:32:55.237
Sorry, bro. Jig was up.


00:32:55.839 --> 00:32:58.739
If I'd have known you were a pro
I'd have tried to haggle you more.


00:32:58.741 --> 00:32:59.941
Fuck it.


00:33:00.643 --> 00:33:02.312
Why would you do that?


00:33:04.614 --> 00:33:09.183
I am tired of you paying for everything.


00:33:09.185 --> 00:33:11.352
You know you can't
control me like that any more.


00:33:11.354 --> 00:33:15.022
That's not the way it is!
Money doesn't mean anything to me.


00:33:15.024 --> 00:33:17.091
Of course! Easy for you to
say from where you're at.


00:33:17.093 --> 00:33:21.562
Sure. Because a drive to LA
sounds like so much fun!


00:33:21.564 --> 00:33:23.163
You said you wanted to see
the countryside with me.


00:33:23.165 --> 00:33:24.465
Yup, you, that's it.


00:33:24.467 --> 00:33:26.767
Had nothing to do with me not
wanting to shove that


00:33:26.769 --> 00:33:30.004
damn baggie up my ass to go
through airport security.


00:33:30.006 --> 00:33:32.540
Jamie, wake up!


00:33:32.542 --> 00:33:35.177
I had to break parole just to
even get here.


00:33:36.302 --> 00:33:37.178
What?!


00:33:37.879 --> 00:33:40.282
Why do you think I wanted
that woman buried too?


00:33:40.784 --> 00:33:44.352
Like I want cops sniffing around.
You know, gimme a break!


00:33:44.354 --> 00:33:46.821
You think all the problems
of the world just gonna


00:33:46.823 --> 00:33:49.290
go away because
you want them to?


00:33:49.292 --> 00:33:50.925
Why didn't you just tell me
the truth?


00:33:50.927 --> 00:33:53.160
You don't want the truth.


00:33:53.162 --> 00:33:54.661
I fell in love with you-


00:33:54.663 --> 00:33:56.430
No, you fell in love with saving me!


00:34:00.602 --> 00:34:02.771
Guess I failed at both of
those things.


00:34:03.373 --> 00:34:05.140
Yeah, well, I guess so too.


00:34:05.542 --> 00:34:07.008
You know what?


00:34:07.010 --> 00:34:08.910
I know you cheated on me!


00:34:09.612 --> 00:34:10.578
Oh fuck.


00:34:11.080 --> 00:34:12.046
What?


00:34:12.048 --> 00:34:14.883
I know what you did with Shelly.


00:34:15.885 --> 00:34:17.084
I don't know what you're
talking about.


00:34:17.086 --> 00:34:17.686
Don't!


00:34:28.131 --> 00:34:30.064
Jamie, it didn't mean anything.


00:34:30.066 --> 00:34:31.869
Don't you fucking dare!


00:34:34.671 --> 00:34:36.605
Men are pigs, Annie!


00:34:37.407 --> 00:34:38.941
Better you know that now.


00:34:40.143 --> 00:34:41.612
Oink, oink.


00:34:45.014 --> 00:34:48.282
Oh, come on. That's was
..that was pretty fucking funny.


00:34:48.284 --> 00:34:50.885
Look. I'm sorry, Jamie.


00:34:50.887 --> 00:34:53.723
If you got shit on doesn't mean
it's gonna happen to me.


00:34:56.125 --> 00:34:56.825
Really?


00:35:00.463 --> 00:35:02.164
You think this
one's any different?


00:35:03.166 --> 00:35:05.803
Look, you're not going there.


00:35:08.705 --> 00:35:10.405
Not on my wedding day.


00:35:18.481 --> 00:35:19.849
Come on...


00:35:21.551 --> 00:35:23.752
You can't judge
everybody like that.


00:35:24.554 --> 00:35:25.753
I'm not.


00:35:26.155 --> 00:35:29.757
If you listened, you'd know I'm
not talking about her.


00:35:29.959 --> 00:35:33.027
Who, Billy?
Come on, he's just all talk.


00:35:33.229 --> 00:35:35.197
I'm not talking about them!


00:35:35.899 --> 00:35:37.364
Ok, listen Jamie, I can expl...


00:35:37.366 --> 00:35:38.733
Don't touch me.


00:35:43.539 --> 00:35:48.976
I was so mad at you. I was so
mad at you I just wanted to


00:35:48.978 --> 00:35:51.714
hurt you like you hurt me.


00:35:53.516 --> 00:35:56.052
I hooked up with Billy last night.


00:35:57.754 --> 00:35:58.753
What?


00:35:58.955 --> 00:36:00.856
In the bathroom.


00:36:01.958 --> 00:36:04.393
You were probably off somewhere
selling your drugs.


00:36:05.595 --> 00:36:07.495
Whoa, whoa, whoa.
What the fuck!?


00:36:07.497 --> 00:36:09.166
At least he doesn't hide
who he is.


00:36:11.668 --> 00:36:13.535
Fine! You know what, go!


00:36:14.837 --> 00:36:16.571
Get back here and let's talk!


00:36:16.973 --> 00:36:17.953
Screw you!


00:36:26.282 --> 00:36:28.651
You know some people just
shouldn't be married.


00:36:30.053 --> 00:36:31.152
What do you mean?


00:36:31.154 --> 00:36:32.487
Think about it.


00:36:32.989 --> 00:36:37.694
You think Roy thought she'd turn
out to be such a nut job?


00:36:39.796 --> 00:36:41.229
Well, I'm not like that.


00:36:42.031 --> 00:36:45.236
Well, I dunno.
How can I be so sure?


00:36:48.638 --> 00:36:50.838
I'm as crazy as you want me to be.


00:37:03.987 --> 00:37:05.119
Oh...


00:37:05.121 --> 00:37:07.087
You are a bad girl.


00:37:08.190 --> 00:37:09.957
If that's what you want.


00:37:26.174 --> 00:37:27.942
Ooooh...


00:37:30.646 --> 00:37:32.848
Seems like someone's joined us.


00:37:33.950 --> 00:37:35.783
You're damn straight.


00:37:36.185 --> 00:37:38.422
I don't need a pill for that, Baby.


00:37:41.624 --> 00:37:43.691
And you never will when
you're with me.


00:38:07.883 --> 00:38:08.984
Billy!?


00:38:09.986 --> 00:38:11.387
He ain't here.


00:38:12.989 --> 00:38:13.922
Hello.


00:38:15.124 --> 00:38:16.557
What do you mean he isn't here?


00:38:16.759 --> 00:38:19.028
I mean what I say.
He ain't around.


00:38:20.730 --> 00:38:22.431
How long have you been there?


00:38:23.933 --> 00:38:25.004
Long enough.


00:38:30.106 --> 00:38:32.306
Easy, easy.
Don't be so damn jumpy.


00:38:32.308 --> 00:38:33.708
You just scared me.


00:38:33.810 --> 00:38:35.277
Not my intention.


00:38:36.979 --> 00:38:37.879
Billy!


00:38:44.387 --> 00:38:45.755
Where's Jamie?


00:38:48.257 --> 00:38:49.457
Screw her.


00:38:49.859 --> 00:38:51.926
Roy. Where's your wife?


00:38:52.861 --> 00:38:54.228
Gone.


00:38:59.234 --> 00:39:03.940
Gone, sayonara, vamoose.
And you what?


00:39:06.142 --> 00:39:07.909
It's all good with me.


00:39:15.951 --> 00:39:17.119
Billy!


00:39:18.321 --> 00:39:19.354
Billy!


00:39:19.856 --> 00:39:20.421
Bill...


00:39:20.423 --> 00:39:21.422
Jesus.


00:39:22.024 --> 00:39:22.957
What?


00:39:22.959 --> 00:39:23.959
Billy...


00:39:24.761 --> 00:39:25.926
I thought you left.


00:39:25.928 --> 00:39:29.363
Where the hell would I go?
I was taking a piss.


00:39:29.365 --> 00:39:30.798
Jamie's gone.


00:39:31.200 --> 00:39:32.399
What?


00:39:32.401 --> 00:39:34.136
He said she just took off.


00:39:35.238 --> 00:39:38.239
Whattaya mean? She just
can't 'take off' out here!


00:39:38.241 --> 00:39:41.242
Said she had enough and, she left.


00:39:41.744 --> 00:39:46.711
Left me, left you,
left this marriage.


00:39:48.950 --> 00:39:50.017
Good riddance.


00:39:50.019 --> 00:39:52.219
She can't be out there alone.


00:39:52.221 --> 00:39:54.256
You're worried about safe now?


00:39:55.158 --> 00:39:55.991
Or...


00:39:57.093 --> 00:39:59.630
maybe you want her back
for your own reasons.


00:40:02.906 --> 00:40:03.906
What is that supposed to mean?


00:40:03.932 --> 00:40:05.065
You know exactly what that means.


00:40:05.067 --> 00:40:08.072
No, Roy. I don't know
exactly what that means.


00:40:11.974 --> 00:40:13.474
We gotta go find her.


00:40:13.776 --> 00:40:15.409
If you think so, but...


00:40:15.411 --> 00:40:17.244
I think that we should split up.


00:40:17.246 --> 00:40:18.913
She couldn't have got far.


00:40:19.415 --> 00:40:20.915
Knock yourselves out.


00:40:20.917 --> 00:40:22.116
Just get your ass up!


00:40:22.118 --> 00:40:24.984
When the fuck did you find a
conscience?


00:40:28.089 --> 00:40:31.149
I don't remember you having one
when you killed that woman.


00:40:37.165 --> 00:40:41.469
Well, couple of bruises and
you turn into Mr. Sunshine, huh?


00:40:41.871 --> 00:40:45.038
Well that's me, baby.
Personality plus.


00:40:48.210 --> 00:40:50.846
She obviously hasn't come
by us, right. So...


00:40:52.048 --> 00:40:55.149
Why don't you head off there.
I'll head off over there.


00:40:55.151 --> 00:40:57.953
If you see her, if you see
anything, Just yell.


00:40:59.555 --> 00:41:01.958
Don't you think we should
just stay together?


00:41:04.560 --> 00:41:07.928
Baby, it's better if we
split up, all right.


00:41:07.930 --> 00:41:09.830
We don't know which way she went.


00:41:09.932 --> 00:41:12.066
Look, just go for ten minutes.


00:41:12.068 --> 00:41:13.668
If you can't find her then come back.


00:41:13.870 --> 00:41:15.769
All right, well just promise
that you're gonna stay close.


00:41:15.771 --> 00:41:18.274
Because I don't want to be
around him when he's like this.


00:41:20.176 --> 00:41:24.412
It's fine, Baby. He's just
pissed because Jamie dumped him.


00:41:24.814 --> 00:41:26.215
I can hear you.


00:41:27.817 --> 00:41:29.016
Ok, well good.


00:41:29.118 --> 00:41:31.952
Then maybe you'll stop creeping
out my fiance.


00:41:32.054 --> 00:41:34.456
Ooo, fiance.


00:41:35.858 --> 00:41:38.061
All right, Baby, go.
Just be careful.


00:41:40.563 --> 00:41:41.730
Fine.


00:41:50.138 --> 00:41:53.307
You know, you're a real
dickhead when you're high.


00:41:55.143 --> 00:41:58.511
Ah, blow me. Ha.


00:41:59.547 --> 00:42:01.215
Blow me.


00:42:07.155 --> 00:42:08.088
Jamie!


00:42:08.090 --> 00:42:09.057
Jamie!


00:42:15.196 --> 00:42:16.564
Jamie!


00:42:16.966 --> 00:42:19.368
Jamie!


00:42:20.870 --> 00:42:22.637
Jamie!


00:42:23.639 --> 00:42:25.540
BILLY!


00:42:26.142 --> 00:42:28.208
Billy! Come Quick!


00:42:33.281 --> 00:42:35.282
Annie, what!? What the fuck!?


00:42:35.284 --> 00:42:36.650
She's dead!


00:42:36.652 --> 00:42:37.418
What!?


00:42:37.420 --> 00:42:38.855
She's dead!


00:42:40.957 --> 00:42:42.556
Fuck. What happened?


00:42:42.558 --> 00:42:46.059
I just saw her lying here
and thought she just passed out.


00:42:46.061 --> 00:42:48.029
Then when I got closer
I saw all the blood.


00:42:49.031 --> 00:42:50.415
Jesus Christ!


00:42:59.141 --> 00:43:01.144
Jesus Christ!


00:43:04.146 --> 00:43:05.245
It's gonna be okay.


00:43:05.247 --> 00:43:06.280
Jamie?


00:43:06.382 --> 00:43:07.782
No, it won't.


00:43:08.084 --> 00:43:09.050
Jamie...


00:43:23.999 --> 00:43:25.667
I'm so sorry.


00:43:26.369 --> 00:43:27.870
Why'd you have to kill her?


00:43:30.072 --> 00:43:31.272
What?


00:43:32.440 --> 00:43:33.640
She's my wife?


00:43:33.642 --> 00:43:34.942
She was your wife.


00:43:34.944 --> 00:43:36.343
Shut the hell up!


00:43:36.345 --> 00:43:38.112
Annie, just leave it.


00:43:48.089 --> 00:43:50.391
Whoever killed that man
must've been back.


00:43:50.593 --> 00:43:52.359
Roy, I didn't see a car.


00:43:52.361 --> 00:43:54.096
That doesn't matter, Billy!


00:43:55.598 --> 00:43:58.001
She said that he used to hit her.


00:44:01.303 --> 00:44:02.336
That's bullshit.


00:44:02.338 --> 00:44:03.704
Then why would she say it?


00:44:03.706 --> 00:44:06.240
She was upset with me
because of something I did.


00:44:06.542 --> 00:44:10.022
That's why she slept with your
man last night!


00:44:11.179 --> 00:44:13.447
Whoa, whoa... No, no, no...


00:44:13.549 --> 00:44:15.682
Don't be dragging me into this shit.


00:44:15.684 --> 00:44:18.304
That didn't happen.
Billy was with me last night.


00:44:20.622 --> 00:44:23.624
She got you jealous so you
killed her.


00:44:24.326 --> 00:44:25.692
Why are you saying this?


00:44:25.694 --> 00:44:27.294
Whoa! Whoa!


00:44:27.696 --> 00:44:29.597
Roy. Both of you.


00:44:30.099 --> 00:44:31.968
Just calm the hell down.


00:44:34.570 --> 00:44:37.872
Listen...
I didn't kill my wife.


00:44:38.274 --> 00:44:41.608
At the very least,
she fell and hit her head.


00:44:41.610 --> 00:44:44.811
Look at her head, you fucking psycho!
It's bashed in!


00:44:44.813 --> 00:44:45.980
Hey you know what, just...


00:44:46.782 --> 00:44:48.248
We'll get the cops out here,


00:44:48.250 --> 00:44:50.052
and we'll let them figure it out.


00:44:51.454 --> 00:44:53.155
You think I did it too?


00:44:54.657 --> 00:44:57.592
That is for the cops to say.


00:44:58.394 --> 00:45:00.160
There's no cops out here, Billy!


00:45:00.162 --> 00:45:04.698
You need to chill the
fuck out, Roy.


00:45:04.700 --> 00:45:05.767
A gun?


00:45:06.569 --> 00:45:10.571
Let's call it my little
security blanket, ok?


00:45:10.773 --> 00:45:11.974
Whattaya gonna do?


00:45:13.476 --> 00:45:14.741
Shoot me now?


00:45:14.743 --> 00:45:18.415
I don't wanna shoot anyone.
Ok, but I will if I have to.


00:45:21.717 --> 00:45:24.019
I can't convince you two I'm
innocent...


00:45:25.421 --> 00:45:27.623
what hope do I have
with any cops.


00:45:29.125 --> 00:45:31.625
If you didn't do it, then
everything's fine.


00:45:31.627 --> 00:45:34.695
They have CSI guys that can
figure this shit out.


00:45:35.197 --> 00:45:39.297
Doesn't work that way when
you have a record like mine.


00:46:05.861 --> 00:46:07.245
I'm so sorry.


00:46:15.771 --> 00:46:17.004
I gotta go.


00:46:17.606 --> 00:46:19.139
You're leaving because
you're guilty.


00:46:19.141 --> 00:46:22.678
I'm leaving because I'm innocent.
Ok?


00:46:24.680 --> 00:46:27.381
We can't just let him go.
Do something.


00:46:27.383 --> 00:46:29.550
Roy, if you didn't do this


00:46:29.552 --> 00:46:33.254
then I think we should all just
stick together. Right?


00:46:33.556 --> 00:46:35.390
I'll take my chances.


00:46:36.192 --> 00:46:38.829
Roy, I'll fucking shoot you.


00:46:42.431 --> 00:46:44.268
I'm not stopping you.


00:46:47.670 --> 00:46:48.838
Roy!


00:46:51.440 --> 00:46:53.107
Fuck...


00:47:06.888 --> 00:47:09.524
Annie, I couldn't just
shoot him in the back.


00:47:10.926 --> 00:47:13.528
It's okay. It's okay.


00:47:14.630 --> 00:47:17.798
Probably better off that
he's gone anyway, right?


00:47:17.900 --> 00:47:20.134
I mean, what if he
didn't kill her?


00:47:20.236 --> 00:47:22.870
He answered that when he ran away.


00:47:23.272 --> 00:47:28.840
Shit. You know what,
I'm not... I'm not thinking straight.


00:47:29.210 --> 00:47:33.279
All the drugs and the booze.
You know, I'd have...


00:47:33.448 --> 00:47:35.882
I'd have fucking killed him if I
had to, though.


00:47:35.884 --> 00:47:37.651
It's okay. He's gone.


00:47:39.254 --> 00:47:43.892
You scared him off. Saved us.
You did.


00:47:45.694 --> 00:47:47.261
Yeah.


00:47:48.630 --> 00:47:50.333
We gotta move out.


00:47:53.435 --> 00:47:54.836
What about Jamie?


00:47:56.238 --> 00:47:58.705
What about her? What, do
you want to take her with us?


00:47:58.707 --> 00:48:00.607
We can't leave her here like this?


00:48:00.609 --> 00:48:02.209
Like what - dead?


00:48:02.311 --> 00:48:04.878
Sprawled out - food for
whatever lives out here.


00:48:04.880 --> 00:48:06.848
I don't think she's gonna
give a shit.


00:48:07.850 --> 00:48:10.818
We don't know how long it's gonna
be until we can get back here.


00:48:11.620 --> 00:48:13.958
It's just like that
woman at your car.


00:48:18.560 --> 00:48:19.927
All right, fine.


00:48:40.682 --> 00:48:43.051
Do you think we should go
back to the car?


00:48:44.953 --> 00:48:49.823
You know what? We never should've listened
to Roy in the first place and left the car.


00:48:50.025 --> 00:48:52.193
Probably all part of his plan.


00:48:52.895 --> 00:48:54.528
Makes sense.


00:48:54.930 --> 00:48:58.800
Yeah... Well he better not
come around here again.


00:48:59.902 --> 00:49:01.838
No more Mr. Nice guy.


00:49:04.840 --> 00:49:06.942
You hear that, Psycho!


00:49:08.844 --> 00:49:10.911
Come on. Let's go.


00:49:29.897 --> 00:49:31.965
Sorry, Jamie.


00:49:43.011 --> 00:49:45.145
- Hey. Hey.
- You wanna stop?


00:49:45.347 --> 00:49:46.313
I'm okay.


00:49:46.515 --> 00:49:49.683
Are you sure? I mean, we
can take a break if you want.


00:49:49.685 --> 00:49:50.851
No, I'll be all right.


00:49:51.053 --> 00:49:52.786
Just give me a second.


00:49:52.788 --> 00:49:54.989
Look! Water!


00:49:55.791 --> 00:49:57.257
It's probably a mirage.


00:49:57.259 --> 00:49:58.959
No, it might be water!


00:49:59.561 --> 00:50:03.264
Sure it is. Bet that's
where they bottle my Evian.


00:50:03.966 --> 00:50:05.382
Jesus. Fuck!


00:50:12.374 --> 00:50:16.044
Yeah, sure.
Thousand years ago, maybe.


00:50:17.346 --> 00:50:18.781
Shut up.


00:50:21.683 --> 00:50:23.050
I hate this place.


00:50:53.614 --> 00:50:54.348
Ohh...


00:50:54.950 --> 00:50:56.084
You okay?


00:50:57.986 --> 00:50:59.588
We gotta stop.


00:51:01.790 --> 00:51:03.423
We can't be too far now.


00:51:03.425 --> 00:51:06.792
Annie, it could be two feet.
We still gotta stop.


00:51:15.503 --> 00:51:17.070
You're still gonna protect me, right?


00:51:17.072 --> 00:51:20.408
Sweetie, from here on out
it is every man for himself.


00:51:22.010 --> 00:51:23.244
Ok...


00:51:23.846 --> 00:51:28.916
Wait. Look, none of this shit
would've happened to me before.


00:51:29.818 --> 00:51:32.918
I need to get back and
straighten everything out.


00:51:40.863 --> 00:51:42.063
What is it, Billy?


00:51:42.865 --> 00:51:43.931
Nothing.


00:51:45.033 --> 00:51:47.104
Nothing, let's
just keep moving.


00:51:50.906 --> 00:51:53.206
Jesus. Look at this place.


00:52:12.194 --> 00:52:14.628
Maybe we should check in
that little baggie again.


00:52:14.730 --> 00:52:16.196
There's no vicodin left.


00:52:16.198 --> 00:52:17.797
What about the percocets?


00:52:17.799 --> 00:52:18.999
That's gone too.


00:52:19.201 --> 00:52:21.868
You ate all the percocets?
Well, what's left in the bag?


00:52:21.870 --> 00:52:26.672
I dunno, Annie! Nothing that's going
to help us out here, I'm sure!


00:52:26.674 --> 00:52:30.513
Look, I'm sorry.
I was just trying to help.


00:52:33.715 --> 00:52:36.987
I know. I'm sorry.


00:52:40.489 --> 00:52:42.689
Look, how much do you
know about me?


00:52:42.991 --> 00:52:44.091
Whattaya mean?


00:52:44.793 --> 00:52:47.761
You obviously googled me
before the audition, right?


00:52:48.263 --> 00:52:50.631
Um, yeah.
A little bit, I guess.


00:52:51.233 --> 00:52:52.900
So, how much do you know?


00:52:54.002 --> 00:52:57.103
I know that you're a big success.


00:52:57.105 --> 00:52:57.904
And...


00:52:58.206 --> 00:53:00.908
You are hot as hell.


00:53:02.210 --> 00:53:04.115
So you know what
happened to me then?


00:53:08.917 --> 00:53:13.289
I've been sober five years,
four months, two days.


00:53:15.691 --> 00:53:18.027
There was a chick I used
to hang out with...


00:53:21.129 --> 00:53:22.998
No, she wasn't some chick.


00:53:24.600 --> 00:53:27.803
Her name was Angie
and I loved her. A lot.


00:53:30.105 --> 00:53:33.075
But she OD'd, on a bad batch.


00:53:35.077 --> 00:53:37.177
I woke up with a
plunger in my arm.


00:53:37.179 --> 00:53:42.150
I'd managed to plunge hers but I
passed out before I did my own.


00:53:43.952 --> 00:53:45.620
They said I killed her.


00:53:46.622 --> 00:53:50.702
Cops wanted to charge me, but,
my lawyers convinced the court that


00:53:52.126 --> 00:53:55.794
I was smart and rich enough
to clean up on my own.


00:54:01.002 --> 00:54:05.574
I've missed that woman everyday
since the day she died.


00:54:08.076 --> 00:54:11.812
But I've been sober since.
Just me against the world.


00:54:12.914 --> 00:54:14.314
Until last night.


00:54:21.223 --> 00:54:22.191
Well...


00:54:24.693 --> 00:54:26.160
you're not alone anymore.


00:54:29.897 --> 00:54:31.935
And we don't need these to
be happy.


00:54:35.337 --> 00:54:37.037
My little muse, huh?


00:54:45.614 --> 00:54:49.851
Listen, I been thinking, Billy.
And after what you just told me...


00:54:51.153 --> 00:54:54.521
You know there was only one person who
was against us burying that woman.


00:54:55.023 --> 00:54:57.025
And burying all the trouble that
went with her.


00:54:59.227 --> 00:55:00.461
With Jamie...


00:55:01.663 --> 00:55:02.429
gone...


00:55:02.931 --> 00:55:04.598
and if Roy runs...


00:55:05.000 --> 00:55:07.935
We're the ones to deal with the
rap on hitting that woman?


00:55:08.637 --> 00:55:10.704
I mean she ran into our road.


00:55:10.706 --> 00:55:12.206
She shot at us.


00:55:13.208 --> 00:55:15.810
She probably even killed that
man back there.


00:55:16.812 --> 00:55:18.580
That's what I've been
saying all along.


00:55:20.382 --> 00:55:25.582
So you agree that we should
just make it all go away.


00:55:30.092 --> 00:55:31.459
I totally agree.


00:55:33.261 --> 00:55:34.828
Come on. Let's go.


00:56:32.086 --> 00:56:34.621
Oh... Wait... Billy?


00:56:34.723 --> 00:56:37.022
Billy! That's the car!
There's the car!


00:56:37.024 --> 00:56:39.859
We found it! Hahaha!


00:56:39.961 --> 00:56:41.695
I knew I'd find it!


00:56:42.297 --> 00:56:43.797
I never doubted you.


00:56:44.499 --> 00:56:45.500
I...


00:56:47.102 --> 00:56:48.869
AM THE GOLDEN CHILD!!


00:56:49.871 --> 00:56:52.172
Well. At least I don't see Roy.


00:56:52.474 --> 00:56:54.240
Come on. Let's go.
It's shelter.


00:56:54.242 --> 00:56:55.475
Come on.


00:56:56.077 --> 00:56:57.744
Someone kill me.


00:57:07.888 --> 00:57:10.891
I am never walking anywhere
ever again.


00:57:11.793 --> 00:57:13.193
Sounds good to me.


00:57:13.995 --> 00:57:15.328
WHOOOO!


00:57:15.330 --> 00:57:16.863
Careful. That might be hot.


00:57:17.065 --> 00:57:18.332
Fuck.


00:57:25.973 --> 00:57:28.008
Think anybody came past
while we were gone?


00:57:29.110 --> 00:57:30.977
I dunno. You see any tracks?


00:57:38.252 --> 00:57:38.985
No.


00:57:39.187 --> 00:57:40.855
Well then, there's your answer.


00:57:42.557 --> 00:57:44.424
Where do you think Roy is?


00:57:44.926 --> 00:57:46.326
Dead I hope.


00:57:47.128 --> 00:57:48.328
What if he comes back?


00:57:48.330 --> 00:57:49.729
Then I'll shoot him.


00:57:49.931 --> 00:57:50.897
You will?


00:57:51.399 --> 00:57:54.266
Fuck him.
We were here first.


00:58:01.876 --> 00:58:03.343
Eventually it's gonna be dark.


00:58:03.345 --> 00:58:06.179
Which means cars will have
to turn on their headlights.


00:58:06.581 --> 00:58:08.581
We won't be able to see
them from here.


00:58:08.583 --> 00:58:12.255
No, not from here. From there.


00:58:15.357 --> 00:58:17.157
We're getting out of here, Baby.


00:58:17.459 --> 00:58:20.160
But first we gotta deal with
that chick in the trunk.


00:58:20.862 --> 00:58:22.262
Let's start digging.


00:58:33.875 --> 00:58:35.009
Ohhh.


00:58:36.511 --> 00:58:37.478
Fuck.


00:59:04.638 --> 00:59:05.774
Yeah.


00:59:08.076 --> 00:59:09.276
This should work.


00:59:10.178 --> 00:59:13.413
You're damn straight. Huh?
Who's the man?


00:59:13.415 --> 00:59:14.717
You are.


00:59:17.419 --> 00:59:19.253
Damn right, Baby.


00:59:20.355 --> 00:59:24.125
'Cause I am Billy fucking Rich!


00:59:25.527 --> 00:59:26.627
Whooo!


00:59:35.570 --> 00:59:38.472
Wow. Ok.


00:59:39.074 --> 00:59:41.174
Vegas, here we come!


00:59:47.215 --> 00:59:48.416
Oh yeah...


00:59:50.018 --> 00:59:52.688
There's gonna be some
cars coming now, baby.


00:59:55.590 --> 00:59:57.690
There's gonna be some
cars coming now.


01:00:06.267 --> 01:00:09.169
It's not like we're in the
fucking outback?


01:00:09.471 --> 01:00:11.238
Where the hell is every one?


01:00:11.940 --> 01:00:13.342
Someone'll find us.


01:00:16.244 --> 01:00:17.577
Are you hungry?


01:00:18.279 --> 01:00:19.646
Starving.


01:00:20.148 --> 01:00:22.216
Why haven't you said anything
about it?


01:00:23.518 --> 01:00:25.221
I don't like complaining.


01:00:28.523 --> 01:00:30.762
Are you sure you're an actress?


01:00:35.964 --> 01:00:36.964
What was that?


01:00:38.166 --> 01:00:39.167
What?


01:00:40.969 --> 01:00:42.502
You didn't hear that?


01:00:43.304 --> 01:00:45.171
There's no nobody out here.


01:00:55.616 --> 01:00:58.618
Oh shit! Get up. Get up!


01:00:58.620 --> 01:01:00.356
It's Roy. Get up!


01:01:03.458 --> 01:01:05.026
What are you doing here?


01:01:07.128 --> 01:01:09.397
Roy, you don't look so good.


01:01:11.399 --> 01:01:12.666
You gotta help me.


01:01:13.568 --> 01:01:18.471
Why don't you let me see your
hands and I'll think about it.


01:01:18.773 --> 01:01:20.339
I didn't kill my wife.


01:01:20.341 --> 01:01:22.542
Yeah, so you said.


01:01:23.344 --> 01:01:24.711
I loved her.


01:01:25.113 --> 01:01:26.950
You weren't acting like it.


01:01:30.752 --> 01:01:32.151
Why don't you sit down?


01:01:32.153 --> 01:01:33.654
She saved me.


01:01:34.756 --> 01:01:36.589
Saved me from myself.


01:01:36.591 --> 01:01:37.957
He said stop.


01:01:38.359 --> 01:01:39.926
You gotta believe me.


01:01:40.428 --> 01:01:42.896
Don't make me fucking shoot you.


01:01:43.198 --> 01:01:44.564
She was my life.


01:01:44.566 --> 01:01:46.401
Don't make me shoot you, Roy.


01:01:48.603 --> 01:01:51.438
Annie. Annie.


01:01:52.540 --> 01:01:53.840
Annie.


01:01:54.642 --> 01:01:57.580
I was there when you woke up.
Remember?


01:02:01.082 --> 01:02:02.181
Where were you?


01:02:02.183 --> 01:02:03.449
The fuck you talking about?


01:02:03.451 --> 01:02:06.920
You had to shut her up,
didn't you?


01:02:07.522 --> 01:02:11.889
He tell you what he
did to my wife last night?


01:02:16.663 --> 01:02:17.697
Billy?


01:02:18.299 --> 01:02:21.304
This is all your fault.


01:02:24.706 --> 01:02:26.439
Billy. Say something.


01:02:26.441 --> 01:02:29.209
Yeah, Billy. Say something.


01:02:29.511 --> 01:02:31.745
It's not the way he's
putting it, Annie.


01:02:32.647 --> 01:02:34.317
She kissed me!


01:02:38.119 --> 01:02:40.154
Look. We didn't...


01:02:41.156 --> 01:02:42.722
The fuck... it... this...


01:02:43.124 --> 01:02:44.557
it doesn't fucking matter anyways.


01:02:44.559 --> 01:02:46.592
You killed her. I didn't.


01:02:46.594 --> 01:02:48.328
She was gonna tell you, Annie


01:02:48.630 --> 01:02:52.067
but he killed her so
you could never find out.


01:02:54.569 --> 01:02:56.636
Billy, where were you when
I was sleeping?


01:02:57.338 --> 01:03:00.673
I was taking a piss. You know that.
I didn't even see her.


01:03:00.675 --> 01:03:02.944
You got as many
witnesses as me.


01:03:05.146 --> 01:03:06.384
I got the truth.


01:03:11.286 --> 01:03:12.351
The truth?


01:03:12.453 --> 01:03:16.455
Hahaha...


01:03:16.457 --> 01:03:20.625
Is that why you
two buried that woman? Huh?


01:03:21.228 --> 01:03:22.396
The truth?


01:03:25.332 --> 01:03:26.399
Oh yeah.


01:03:28.368 --> 01:03:30.636
I know more than you think.


01:03:34.708 --> 01:03:36.576
But I got a gun.


01:03:36.578 --> 01:03:39.814
So why don't you shut the fuck
up and sit down.


01:03:41.416 --> 01:03:42.984
You know what Billy?


01:03:44.886 --> 01:03:46.921
You ain't got the balls.


01:03:48.623 --> 01:03:50.627
Why don't you try me, Roy?


01:03:54.329 --> 01:03:55.962
Stop! Billy!


01:03:56.264 --> 01:03:57.231
Stop!


01:03:58.433 --> 01:04:00.099
Shoot... Billy!


01:04:00.301 --> 01:04:01.702
BILLY!


01:04:03.404 --> 01:04:04.837
Roy! Stop!


01:04:09.911 --> 01:04:11.511
Ughhh...


01:04:12.513 --> 01:04:13.648
Shit...


01:04:15.250 --> 01:04:16.283
Oh... Ughhh...


01:04:20.821 --> 01:04:22.489
Oh fuck...


01:04:23.591 --> 01:04:24.671
Oh fuck...


01:04:29.497 --> 01:04:30.497
Fuck!


01:04:31.599 --> 01:04:33.766
He went fucking crazy!


01:04:33.868 --> 01:04:36.869
You needed to. You needed to.
You had to.


01:04:36.871 --> 01:04:38.838
He was fucking crazy!


01:04:39.340 --> 01:04:43.344
You had to. To save me.
You did.


01:04:44.646 --> 01:04:47.580
I never killed Jamie.
I never killed anyone... ever.


01:04:47.582 --> 01:04:50.285
Listen to me. I believe you.
Ok? I believe you.


01:04:52.287 --> 01:04:53.986
What he said about last
night, Annie...


01:04:53.988 --> 01:04:55.121
Ssssh.


01:04:55.723 --> 01:04:58.924
It doesn't matter, ok? We all
have a past. I told you that.


01:04:58.926 --> 01:05:01.327
And that's what this is.
This is the past.


01:05:01.529 --> 01:05:03.362
Whatever he said...
look at me...


01:05:03.464 --> 01:05:04.864
it doesn't matter.


01:05:05.366 --> 01:05:09.203
'Cause as long as we're together,
we're gonna be fine.


01:05:10.305 --> 01:05:15.574
We're gonna be fine. Ok?
Ok.


01:05:15.576 --> 01:05:16.944
Look at me. Look at me.


01:05:18.846 --> 01:05:20.213
We're gonna be fine.


01:05:36.563 --> 01:05:39.200
You know, this actually
might work out.


01:05:41.302 --> 01:05:43.337
We know that Roy killed Jamie.


01:05:44.639 --> 01:05:46.807
And we can say that
he was driving too.


01:05:48.409 --> 01:05:50.610
That he went crazy and
attacked us.


01:05:51.012 --> 01:05:54.548
That way we won't have to hide
any more dead bodies out here.


01:05:55.450 --> 01:05:57.752
Billy, what if Roy didn't
kill Jamie?


01:05:59.554 --> 01:06:02.156
What if whoever killed that guy
in the suit came back and did it?


01:06:04.058 --> 01:06:05.926
What if he's watching us now?


01:06:06.928 --> 01:06:09.095
No. There's nobody else out here.


01:06:09.397 --> 01:06:11.365
Baby, it's okay. You're safe.


01:06:12.467 --> 01:06:14.668
Then what if Jamie really did fall?


01:06:15.970 --> 01:06:17.102
You said Roy...


01:06:17.104 --> 01:06:18.805
I said I think Roy did it.


01:06:19.507 --> 01:06:21.341
But you know how the cops are.


01:06:22.543 --> 01:06:24.543
If they prove it was a accident,
we don't want them to be


01:06:24.545 --> 01:06:26.479
suspicious about you shooting Roy.


01:06:26.581 --> 01:06:28.447
And what happens if
they find that woman?


01:06:28.549 --> 01:06:30.049
Roy attacked me.


01:06:30.051 --> 01:06:32.752
And that's exactly what
we'll tell them - if we have to.


01:06:35.856 --> 01:06:37.223
But think about it.


01:06:39.893 --> 01:06:42.428
They're just a couple of
tourists we met last night.


01:06:42.430 --> 01:06:43.997
Who knows what happened
after that?


01:06:46.333 --> 01:06:48.201
Maybe we came out
here on our own.


01:06:49.836 --> 01:06:51.404
I don't know, Annie.


01:06:52.006 --> 01:06:55.646
I don't think that we should push
our luck farther than we gotta.


01:06:57.477 --> 01:06:57.977
Yeah.


01:07:01.949 --> 01:07:05.485
I just can't bear the thought of seeing
you in prison, Billy. It'd kill me.


01:07:06.387 --> 01:07:07.253
What?


01:07:07.555 --> 01:07:09.755
I would do anything for
you to stop that.


01:07:11.758 --> 01:07:13.026
Even this.


01:07:15.429 --> 01:07:16.696
And the way I see it...


01:07:18.064 --> 01:07:20.333
there are tons of dead
bodies out here anyway.


01:07:21.468 --> 01:07:22.836
What's one more?


01:07:29.743 --> 01:07:31.310
Aw, fuck.


01:07:40.754 --> 01:07:42.456
This is the right thing to do.


01:07:43.658 --> 01:07:46.226
I don't want anybody
questioning you about murder.


01:07:46.928 --> 01:07:47.827
Murder?


01:07:47.929 --> 01:07:49.328
Don't even think about it.


01:07:49.330 --> 01:07:50.832
It won't come to that.


01:07:52.934 --> 01:07:54.466
We have too big a future
ahead of us


01:07:54.468 --> 01:07:55.868
to let this get in the way.


01:07:55.970 --> 01:07:57.370
Future?


01:07:57.872 --> 01:07:59.672
I am fucked, Annie.


01:07:59.874 --> 01:08:01.075
I'm done.


01:08:02.977 --> 01:08:05.377
You're not done.
You're the golden boy.


01:08:13.821 --> 01:08:15.890
The studio fired me yesterday.


01:08:17.592 --> 01:08:22.397
That retread of a bitch Lyla had me
replaced with her douchebag boyfriend.


01:08:25.099 --> 01:08:26.767
But it was your show.


01:08:27.869 --> 01:08:30.104
It's always the studio's show.


01:08:31.606 --> 01:08:32.773
What happened?


01:08:34.175 --> 01:08:37.911
A year ago she was back
hostessing at the SaddleRanch.


01:08:38.713 --> 01:08:41.180
Now she has a record deal,
a perfume brand,


01:08:41.282 --> 01:08:45.686
and she's probably flogging a line of
goddamn tampons at Target...


01:08:47.788 --> 01:08:48.954
Now my show.


01:08:48.956 --> 01:08:50.289
Bye bye, baby.


01:08:50.491 --> 01:08:52.024
But her boyfriend?


01:08:52.226 --> 01:08:54.726
It's the Hollywood way, Baby.


01:09:01.936 --> 01:09:03.336
You'll get another one.


01:09:04.238 --> 01:09:05.238
Annie...


01:09:06.040 --> 01:09:07.306
I'm forty.


01:09:09.075 --> 01:09:12.155
That's like a hundred in
Hollywood years, ok.


01:09:12.646 --> 01:09:15.314
If I don't have the mojo to
overrule that bitch...


01:09:19.352 --> 01:09:20.720
Then I got nothing.


01:09:29.162 --> 01:09:30.430
But you know what?


01:09:36.503 --> 01:09:38.371
We don't need that shit town.


01:09:40.007 --> 01:09:43.242
What?
It's a hole. It's a cesspool.


01:09:43.744 --> 01:09:47.046
It'll eat up sweet, innocent
girls like you.


01:09:47.048 --> 01:09:48.582
Look what it did to me?


01:09:49.984 --> 01:09:51.350
We can leave.


01:09:51.652 --> 01:09:53.219
We'll go somewhere free.


01:09:54.021 --> 01:09:57.690
We'll take a chance.
The whole world is open to us.


01:09:58.292 --> 01:09:59.193
Listen.


01:10:00.595 --> 01:10:02.896
I want to give you that white
picket fence,


01:10:03.998 --> 01:10:05.698
and those 2.5 children,


01:10:05.700 --> 01:10:07.666
and those puppies,
and those fireworks,


01:10:07.668 --> 01:10:09.535
and all that apple pie crap.


01:10:10.237 --> 01:10:11.705
You said it yourself.


01:10:12.607 --> 01:10:13.806
We're a team.


01:10:14.108 --> 01:10:17.912
As long as we stick together,
nothing can stop us.


01:10:19.614 --> 01:10:20.780
Yeah...


01:10:21.082 --> 01:10:21.882
Sure.


01:10:27.989 --> 01:10:29.489
Now come on.


01:10:30.291 --> 01:10:32.896
Let's get off
this god damn mountain.


01:10:37.198 --> 01:10:38.664
Annie, come on.


01:10:52.078 --> 01:10:53.212
You know what, baby?


01:10:53.314 --> 01:10:54.713
We'll go to Canada.


01:10:54.915 --> 01:10:57.116
I shot a movie there in '99.


01:10:57.218 --> 01:10:59.618
Those people don't even lock
their doors.


01:10:59.920 --> 01:11:01.253
Don't they live in igloos?


01:11:01.255 --> 01:11:03.022
HaHa. Igloos.


01:11:06.593 --> 01:11:07.861
Shit, baby. Headlights!


01:11:10.130 --> 01:11:11.797
I knew they'd come!


01:11:15.935 --> 01:11:17.503
You know what, you're right.


01:11:18.638 --> 01:11:21.943
You're right, we don't need the
press from this.


01:11:24.745 --> 01:11:26.179
We need to hide the evidence.


01:11:26.781 --> 01:11:27.548
Annie?


01:11:29.150 --> 01:11:29.950
Annie?


01:11:31.952 --> 01:11:33.887
Let's go back to the start.


01:11:34.789 --> 01:11:36.125
How did you meet Billy Rich?


01:11:40.027 --> 01:11:41.127
At the wrap party.


01:11:42.930 --> 01:11:44.997
I didn't even know who
Billy Rich was.


01:11:45.732 --> 01:11:48.693
And he certainly wasn't the type of
person I planned on being around.


01:11:58.078 --> 01:12:01.180
I wanted to leave.
It just wasn't my scene.


01:12:01.382 --> 01:12:02.748
But you didn't.


01:12:04.718 --> 01:12:05.485
No.


01:12:08.321 --> 01:12:09.455
I didn't.


01:12:09.957 --> 01:12:12.924
Billy called me over,
bought me a drink.


01:12:14.694 --> 01:12:17.662
I auditioned for you...
for this show.


01:12:18.698 --> 01:12:20.699
I audition a lot of girls.


01:12:21.001 --> 01:12:22.068
Not like me.


01:12:23.270 --> 01:12:25.337
Well that remains to be seen.


01:12:26.840 --> 01:12:28.960
Wasn't long before I
learned he was Billy Rich.


01:12:29.843 --> 01:12:31.710
Hollywood's prodigal son.


01:12:34.147 --> 01:12:37.749
I mean what harm could come from
letting him buy me a few drinks?


01:12:38.451 --> 01:12:42.019
We drank, talked, laughed.


01:12:44.758 --> 01:12:47.959
It was like I was inside a world I'd
always looked at from the outside.


01:12:52.766 --> 01:12:54.533
It was all so innocent.


01:13:08.047 --> 01:13:10.115
Billy said I was the muse
he always wanted.


01:13:15.255 --> 01:13:18.323
I know I was just wrapped up in
the moment but it was so sweet.


01:13:19.826 --> 01:13:21.494
Like I always imagined.


01:13:23.296 --> 01:13:24.963
I felt like a princess.


01:13:32.172 --> 01:13:33.739
And then it all went to hell.


01:13:36.442 --> 01:13:39.210
That crash. She was dead.


01:13:41.981 --> 01:13:45.301
It was so hot, none of us could
think straight.


01:13:49.255 --> 01:13:50.523
It was horrible.


01:13:52.125 --> 01:13:55.806
Then Billy brought out all this
champagne... and pills.


01:13:57.832 --> 01:14:00.966
But the pain from the accident
was so bad.


01:14:01.268 --> 01:14:02.935
How stupid could I be?


01:14:11.978 --> 01:14:13.045
Are you okay?


01:14:17.483 --> 01:14:18.618
It's nothing.


01:14:19.220 --> 01:14:20.520
Tell me what happened.


01:14:21.522 --> 01:14:22.889
Start with Roy.


01:14:29.128 --> 01:14:31.296
I tried to keep everyone as
calm as I could.


01:14:31.431 --> 01:14:32.965
Just shoot him!


01:14:33.067 --> 01:14:35.801
I pleaded for him to stop.


01:14:36.003 --> 01:14:39.170
If only I had been stronger I could have
stopped it before anyone else got hurt.


01:14:39.238 --> 01:14:40.006
KILL HIM!


01:14:46.579 --> 01:14:47.882
It was horrible.


01:14:50.284 --> 01:14:51.685
Billy shot Roy.


01:14:53.087 --> 01:14:54.790
Shot him right in the chest.


01:14:57.892 --> 01:14:59.727
There was just so much blood.


01:15:01.929 --> 01:15:03.129
And Jamie?


01:15:03.831 --> 01:15:05.732
When things got crazy,
she took off.


01:15:07.134 --> 01:15:07.934
Jamie!


01:15:11.138 --> 01:15:13.138
She was already a mess when
I found her.


01:15:20.447 --> 01:15:22.751
I could have had anybody I wanted.


01:15:26.353 --> 01:15:28.753
And I ended up with Roy.


01:15:35.296 --> 01:15:39.532
Prison broke him,
I know that now.


01:15:40.434 --> 01:15:42.601
Something you might want to think
about if they press charges


01:15:42.603 --> 01:15:44.604
against Billy for killing
that woman.


01:15:45.606 --> 01:15:47.007
What do you mean?


01:15:49.209 --> 01:15:50.777
We can't hide what happened.


01:15:52.179 --> 01:15:53.478
Billy shouldn't have been driving.


01:15:53.480 --> 01:15:54.880
It was an accident.


01:15:55.182 --> 01:15:57.183
Then I guess the authorities
will figure that out.


01:15:57.885 --> 01:15:59.987
I'm not gonna hide the truth, though.


01:16:02.289 --> 01:16:04.623
Billy was driving
and Billy hit her.


01:16:04.625 --> 01:16:07.395
He doesn't seem to show a lot of
remorse about that either.


01:16:10.197 --> 01:16:12.501
Are you sure you know who you're
getting involved with?


01:16:16.403 --> 01:16:18.006
I really wish I had.


01:16:21.508 --> 01:16:23.475
Shut the fuck up, bitch!


01:16:29.315 --> 01:16:30.783
Annie...


01:16:31.385 --> 01:16:32.586
Annie...


01:16:34.588 --> 01:16:36.958
You're not doing this to me.


01:16:39.460 --> 01:16:41.193
I heard her scream...


01:16:41.195 --> 01:16:42.597
and came running.


01:16:44.999 --> 01:16:46.566
My God, it was horrible.


01:16:47.968 --> 01:16:50.636
Billy was rambling about how she
was gonna tell.


01:16:51.238 --> 01:16:54.241
How she wouldn't hide the drunk
driving, hitting that woman.


01:16:56.143 --> 01:16:58.980
He held her face in
the dirt as she kicked.


01:17:01.682 --> 01:17:02.950
Dying.


01:17:05.552 --> 01:17:07.887
The look in Billy's eyes when he
saw me.


01:17:09.289 --> 01:17:14.789
He was cold, emotionless,
like an animal.


01:17:20.334 --> 01:17:22.105
He was against everyone now.


01:17:27.007 --> 01:17:28.173
Billy!


01:17:28.675 --> 01:17:30.109
Then Roy showed up.


01:17:30.711 --> 01:17:32.878
He rushed at Billy...
but Billy had a gun.


01:17:33.680 --> 01:17:35.882
Poor Roy.
There was nothing he could do.


01:17:37.684 --> 01:17:40.619
He herded Roy and me back
towards the car at gun point.


01:17:41.321 --> 01:17:43.557
Rambling. Threatening.


01:17:45.459 --> 01:17:47.160
Roy just couldn't take it anymore.


01:17:48.462 --> 01:17:51.434
The idea of that bastard
killing his wife?


01:17:55.436 --> 01:17:56.971
Roy went after Billy.


01:17:59.173 --> 01:18:00.610
And died for it.


01:18:05.412 --> 01:18:06.712
Bottom line?


01:18:07.114 --> 01:18:08.849
You're lucky to be alive.


01:18:11.051 --> 01:18:12.551
We need to hide the evidence.


01:18:12.553 --> 01:18:14.252
Here. Get rid of that.


01:18:14.354 --> 01:18:15.587
He was slapping me.


01:18:15.589 --> 01:18:17.956
Hitting me so hard I thought I'd
black out.


01:18:18.358 --> 01:18:19.792
He wouldn't stop.


01:18:20.594 --> 01:18:22.328
I knew what was next.


01:18:23.630 --> 01:18:25.430
He gave me no choice.


01:18:32.206 --> 01:18:33.438
Annie, what are you doing?


01:18:33.440 --> 01:18:35.041
You lied to me.


01:18:36.643 --> 01:18:38.176
What are you talking about?


01:18:38.278 --> 01:18:40.079
You said you'd make me a star.


01:18:40.681 --> 01:18:42.647
Annie, I will make you a star.


01:18:42.649 --> 01:18:45.850
You really think I wanna be a
